name: release-planner
description: Plans and documents software releases. Use when preparing a release, writing a rollout or deployment plan, defining release phases, cutting a release branch, drafting release notes, or coordinating a staged rollout. Triggers include "release", "rollout", "deploy plan", "release notes", "출시", "배포 계획", "릴리스".
